--[[
    OP1 ACCOUNT CHECKER + PERFORMANCE PANEL
    ---------------------------------------
    Scanner:
      • Scan up to 8 usernames (comma/space separated)
      • Scan current lobby
      • Account age / friends / badge sample / groups / avatar asset count
      • FPS/shooter badge keyword hits
      • Risk score + Alt Likelihood score
      • Manual Clean / Suspicious / Cheater tags
      • Optional persistent DB if readfile/writefile/isfile are supported

    Performance:
      • FPS counter
      • FPS cap toggle -> 9999 if setfpscap exists
      • Potato mode
      • Strip textures
      • Simple materials
      • Remove particles
      • Remove shadows
      • Remove post effects
      • Remove atmosphere/clouds
      • Restore visuals

    UI:
      • Modern dark panel
      • Draggable
      • RightShift hide/show
      • Unload button

    NOTE:
      Scores are heuristics only. They are NOT proof of cheating.
]]

